#: ../../../api/python/vtkmodules/vtkmodules.util.views_scivis.md:102
msgid "None"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../Wrapping/Python/vtkmodules/util/views_scivis.py:114
msgid ""
"Accepts ``None`` (a surface representation), a name "
"from :data:`REPRESENTATION_TYPES`, or a representation class."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../Wrapping/Python/vtkmodules/util/views_scivis.py:121
msgid ""
"*color* is either a 3-sequence with components in ``[0, 1]`` or a snake_case "
"named color from :mod:`vtkmodules.util.colors` (e.g. ``\"tomato\"``, "
"``\"steel_blue\"``)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../Wrapping/Python/vtkmodules/util/views_scivis.py:128
msgid ""
"The override classes below add properties of their own -- named colors, and "
"anything reached by delegation -- that the wrapped class knows nothing "
"about.  Deciding what VTK's own constructor handling will accept has to ask "
"that class, not this one."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../Wrapping/Python/vtkmodules/util/views_scivis.py:135
msgid ""
"Attribute assignment on a Python subclass of a VTK object quietly creates an "
"instance attribute, which would turn a misspelled keyword argument into a "
"property that silently does nothing.  Keyword arguments are checked here so "
"that they fail where the mistake was made."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../Wrapping/Python/vtkmodules/util/views_scivis.py:143
msgid ""
"The C++ classes carry only what it takes to make data visible and legible; "
"everything else lives on the actor, property, mapper or filter underneath. "
"That is the right shape for C++, where reaching one object further is a "
"method call, but it would spoil ``view.show(src, specular=0.3)`` in Python, "
"where flat keyword arguments are the whole point."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../Wrapping/Python/vtkmodules/util/views_scivis.py:149
msgid ""
"So an attribute this class does not define is looked for on each delegate in "
"turn, and set on the first that has it.  ``rep.specular = 0.3`` and "
"``rep.property.specular = 0.3`` are then the same thing, and an attribute "
"nobody owns still fails, naming the delegates it looked in."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../api/python/vtkmodules/vtkmodules.util.views_scivis.md:143
#: ../../../api/python/vtkmodules/vtkmodules.util.views_scivis.md:190
