msgid "Initialization"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../Wrapping/Python/vtkmodules/util/views_scivis.py:147
#: ../../../../../Wrapping/Python/vtkmodules/util/views_scivis.py:194
#: ../../../../../Wrapping/Python/vtkmodules/util/views_scivis.py:407
#: ../../../../../Wrapping/Python/vtkmodules/util/views_scivis.py:449
#: ../../../../../Wrapping/Python/vtkmodules/util/views_scivis.py:483
#: ../../../../../Wrapping/Python/vtkmodules/util/views_scivis.py:573
msgid "Accept in the constructor everything assignment accepts."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../Wrapping/Python/vtkmodules/util/views_scivis.py:149
#: ../../../../../Wrapping/Python/vtkmodules/util/views_scivis.py:196
#: ../../../../../Wrapping/Python/vtkmodules/util/views_scivis.py:409
#: ../../../../../Wrapping/Python/vtkmodules/util/views_scivis.py:451
#: ../../../../../Wrapping/Python/vtkmodules/util/views_scivis.py:485
#: ../../../../../Wrapping/Python/vtkmodules/util/views_scivis.py:575
msgid ""
"VTK builds its own constructor keyword handling from the properties a class "
"declares, and it runs before any Python attribute assignment -- so it never "
"reaches the delegation below, and ``view.specular = 0.3`` would work while "
"``Class(specular=0.3)`` did not.  Anything VTK does not recognise is applied "
"here instead, which puts the two back in step."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../Wrapping/Python/vtkmodules/util/views_scivis.py:155
#: ../../../../../Wrapping/Python/vtkmodules/util/views_scivis.py:202
#: ../../../../../Wrapping/Python/vtkmodules/util/views_scivis.py:415
